.venv/
data/cache/
runs/

# The repo-root rules ignore every *.pt and every directory named experiments/.
# Both are the right default; these are the two deliberate exceptions.

# The shipped checkpoint, so the backend can serve the learned engine from a
# fresh clone. Ablation checkpoints stay local: they exist to produce a number
# in the report, not to be served.
!models/masked_satb.pt

# The post-mortem reconstruction. It is small, it is pure Python, and it is the
# only thing that makes section 2 of eval/REPORT.md reproducible rather than
# asserted, which is the whole point of the rewrite.
!experiments/
